# What the installer's build may see: the agent's own files and the five modules it shares with the
# file-organising agent. Never the release key, a certificate, or anything else from shadow-filer/ (which
# holds personal data and the code that changes a PC).
*
!device-agent/agent.py
!device-agent/winsvc.py
!device-agent/selfupdate.py
!device-agent/release.py
!device-agent/build/make_msi.py
!device-agent/build/requirements.txt
!shadow-filer/fleet.py
!shadow-filer/apps.py
!shadow-filer/services.py
!shadow-filer/network.py
!shadow-filer/compliance.py
